Package: fslog
Version: 0.0.0-replaced-by-makefile
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: replaced-by-makefile
Maintainer: Jérôme Poulin <jeromepoulin@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ticpu/freeswitch-log-parser
Description: UUID-aware search tool for FreeSWITCH log files
 Structured log search that understands FreeSWITCH's line formats: reads
 rotated .xz files directly and chains them in date order, groups multi-line
 CHANNEL_DATA and SDP blocks, recovers truncated buffer collisions, and
 follows a call across its bridged and transferred legs. Includes a live
 TUI call table and shell completions.
